# What this engine says, case by case, for itit.
#
# Every line was blessed by IBM's own binary when it was
# first written: the whole differential suite was run
# for this language immediately before, and every case
# matched. A case a deliberate divergence has moved or
# added since is this engine's answer and not IBM's;
# docs/quirks.md names them. See docs/testing.md.
#
# The wide cases are the wideband voice, which IBM never
# made: an ear blessed them, not an original.
#
# Written by test/matrix.sh record. One line a case:
# the category, which case in it, the first sixteen hex of
# the samples' hash, the same of the reported answers', and
# the sentence.

